Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   The user's ongoing autonomous development request: "按 CLAUDE.md 中 P0→P1→P2 优先级顺序继续上次未完成的改进" (continue P0→P1→P2 priority improvements per CLAUDE.md). After an API 402 usage limit interruption, the user said "请继续" (please continue). The game project is 城市浮生记 (City Life Story) at `D:\Claude Code+DeepSeekV4\city-life-story\`, entry point `src/index.html`.

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - Pure vanilla JS/HTML/CSS SPA, no framework, no npm (CLAUDE.md constraint)
   - StateManager singleton (Proxy-based dirty marking → renderAll())
   - Script loading order fixed in index.html (Core→Data→Phase1→Phase2→UI→Main) — must NOT change
   - NEWS_EVENTS array in news.js with `investmentEffect` arrays (new, added this session)
   - `applyNewsEffect(news, state)` in news.js handles all news effects including new investment market shocks
   - `investmentEffect` rule format: `{ industry, category, symbols, btc, allStocks, mul }`
   - INV_STOCKS array in investment.js: 30 stocks (科技/新能源/消费/金融/房地产/医药 industries) + 10 crypto + 8 precious metals + 12 futures
   - `tickInvestmentDaily(state)` in investment.js: daily price update with trend+volatility
   - RANDOM_EVENTS array in events.js (moral flag consequence events appended)
   - `getNpcPresenceBonus(locKey, jobId, state)` in skill_bonuses.js (new)
   - `getNpcPresenceBonusDesc(locKey, jobId, state)` in skill_bonuses.js (new)
   - NPC `presenceBonus` array field: `[{ minAffinity, jobs, multiplier }]`
   - NPC `studyPresenceBonus` field on 小美: `{ minAffinity: 30, studyPointBonus: 2 }`
   - Fame-gated VIP actions using `state.flags._fameVipUsedToday` (reset daily)
   - `getInvestmentContextLine(npcId, state)` in main.js for investment-aware NPC dialogue
   - STREET_JOBS array in jobs.js with `educationRequired` field (0=大专, 1=本科)
   - `getJobsAtLocation(locKey)` in locations.js drives which jobs appear per location
   - CLAUDE.md constraints: no git push, no external libs, no script order changes, no file deletion, update DEVELOPMENT.md after each feature, git commit every 3 features

3. Files and Code Sections:

   **`src/js/data/news.js`** — Completely rewritten (was 252 lines)
   - Added `investmentEffect` arrays to 10 existing news events (metal_boom, heatwave, crackdown, factory_boom, construction_boom, cigarette_ban, back_to_school, cold_wave, tech_fair, min_wage)
   - Added 13 new `type: "investment"` events: rate_cut, rate_hike, property_cooling, property_stimulus, geopolitical_crisis, trade_war_chip, ai_boom, crypto_bull, crypto_crash, energy_crisis, black_swan, ev_subsidy, antitrust_investigation
   - Updated `getRandomNewsEvent()` weights to `{ price: 35, job: 20, personal: 20, policy: 10, investment: 15 }` (removed old for-of, now uses for-in loop)
   - Added investment market linkage block to `applyNewsEffect()`:
   ```js
   if (effects.investmentEffect && state.investment) {
     var rules = effects.investmentEffect;
     var inv = state.investment;
     var hasInvStocks = typeof INV_STOCKS !== "undefined";
     for (var ri = 0; ri < rules.length; ri++) {
       var rule = rules[ri];
       var mul = rule.mul || rule.multiplier || 1.0;
       if (mul === 1.0) continue;
       if (rule.btc) {
         if (inv.btcPrice) {
           inv.btcPrice = Math.max(1000, Math.round(inv.btcPrice * mul));
           inv.btcFearGreed = Math.max(5, Math.min(95,
             (inv.btcFearGreed || 50) + (mul > 1 ? 18 : -18)));
         }
         continue;
       }
       if (!hasInvStocks || !inv.stockMarket) continue;
       for (var si = 0; si < INV_STOCKS.length; si++) {
         var stock = INV_STOCKS[si];
         var mkt = inv.stockMarket[stock.symbol];
         if (!mkt) continue;
         var hit = false;
         if (rule.allStocks) hit = true;
         if (rule.industry && stock.industry === rule.industry) hit = true;
         if (rule.category && stock.category === rule.category) hit = true;
         if (rule.symbols && rule.symbols.indexOf(stock.symbol) >= 0) hit = true;
         if (hit) {
           mkt.price = Math.max(0.000001, mkt.price * mul);
           if (mkt.price >= 100) mkt.price = Math.round(mkt.price * 100) / 100;
           else if (mkt.price >= 0.1) mkt.price = Math.round(mkt.price * 1000) / 1000;
           else if (mkt.price >= 0.0001) mkt.price = Math.round(mkt.price * 100000) / 100000;
           else mkt.price = Math.round(mkt.price * 10000000) / 10000000;
         }
       }
     }
   }
   ```

   **`src/js/core/events.js`** — Multiple edits
   - Modified `rollDailyNews` to allow 8% chance of investment news during street phase:
   ```js
   function rollDailyNews(state) {
     if (state.player.phase === "street") {
       rollStreetEvent(state);
       if (Math.random() < 0.08 && typeof getRandomNewsEvent === "function") {
         var investNews = null;
         for (var _attempt = 0; _attempt < 5; _attempt++) {
           var candidate = getRandomNewsEvent();
           if (candidate && candidate.type === "investment" &&
               !(state.flags.seenNewsToday || []).includes(candidate.id)) {
             investNews = candidate; break;
           }
         }
         if (investNews) {
           investNews._appliedDay = state.player.day;
           state.activeNews = state.activeNews || [];
           state.activeNews.push(investNews);
           state.flags.seenNewsToday = state.flags.seenNewsToday || [];
           state.flags.seenNewsToday.push(investNews.id);
           applyNewsEffect(investNews, state);
           StateManager.addMessage("📰 " + investNews.headline, "event");
         }
       }
       return;
     }
     // ... rest of function unchanged
   }
   ```
