     - `fakegoods_threatened` (fame>=15, _refusedFakeGoods, day>=20): 假货商威胁 (3 choices, sets _fakegoodsThreat)
     - `wage_thief_retaliate` (day>=35, _foughtWageTheft): 欠薪包工头打击报复 (3 choices, sets _wageThiefRevenge)
